Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:02.85,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then will you help with my ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.27,0:00:07.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'd like you to make \Nbacon I can eat, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.46,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Bacon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:10.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And I want Riyah to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:11.28,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.66,0:00:13.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course I'll pay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:16.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think it's better than \Nwasting your time away, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:20.47,main,HANK,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.87,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I'll do it, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:02:00.03,main - top,SIGN,0,0,0,,FLYING AND ROASTING AND BEING INVITED
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:57.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Here's my new product,\Nthe giant hairless rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.03,0:02:00.18,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,For holding and going to sleep with?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.25,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:03.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I received feedback that \Nif the pillow is different,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.73,0:02:06.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,it can be harder to fall \Nasleep even on a water bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:09.13,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,With this, you will fall \Nasleep no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:10.41,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Would you like to try?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:15.11,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I'll be obsessed \Nonce I touch it, so I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:16.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.64,0:02:17.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.41,0:02:21.57,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I'll stay away as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.91,0:02:23.39,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:27.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,My sleeping beauties await, \Nso please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:33.69,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,It seems to be going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.69,0:02:35.16,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,It's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:38.97,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,He built such an efficient system \Nto make money in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.27,0:02:40.93,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Reyes is doing well, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:44.66,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Hank and Riyah have started their \Nexperiments thanks to Kunon's advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.77,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Today marks one month \Nsince they enrolled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:50.40,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I suppose we don't need \Nto supervise them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:53.90,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,A month, huh? Perhaps the \Nfactions will make a move soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:57.34,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Is Kunon here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:59.26,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,I'd like to speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.26,0:03:00.53,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:03.91,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:05.11,main,ARIANE/BEATTIE/CICELY,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:08.49,main,ARIANE/BEATTIE/CICELY,0,0,0,,Please excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.23,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,They're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:13.75,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,I can see a fierce battle already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:20.17,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Now we have soft, smooth, \Ngiant hairless rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.17,0:03:22.55,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The perfect companion\N for your peaceful sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.30,main,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,A 60-minute course with the add-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:26.93,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,I'll take a 90-minute course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:29.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,The business is doing well as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:37.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:46.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You burned it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.41,0:03:53.81,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.17,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.66,0:04:01.69,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:07.93,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I want you to make bacon \Nthat can satisfy me soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:12.43,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I've never made bacon with \Nfire magic before, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:17.06,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Bacon is smoked for a long time, \Nrather than putting it on the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.35,0:04:21.21,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think it's possible if you \Ncan maintain a constant heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.71,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I understand that,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:26.11,main,HANK,0,0,0,,but maintaining it for a \Nlong time is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:28.83,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:32.20,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then you've got to try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.05,0:04:34.22,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fu-ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:43.34,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:45.66,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Eek!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:50.81,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.82,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you, Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:02.28,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You need to figure out how \Nto float with stability first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:03.32,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.43,0:05:11.08,main,CHEFF,0,0,0,,Here are your sandwiches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.33,main,CHEFF,0,0,0,,The bacon's totally burnt... \NAre you sure this is okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:18.33,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes. I can't let food go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.10,0:05:22.34,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You take responsibility \Nand eat these, too, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:23.51,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:26.10,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,May I have some as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.47,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I want to save up as much money as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:29.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:33.65,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hank and I won't be able to finish \Nall these sandwiches ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.45,0:05:39.83,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Hello, Miss Reyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:48.52,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I never imagined {\i1}you {\i0}\Nwould invite {\i1}me{\i0} to lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:51.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,May I talk about how \Nmoved I am all day long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.07,main,REYES,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.07,0:05:57.99,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I don't have to pay when I go to lunch \Nwith you, so I'm grateful for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This isn't... quite edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:08.22,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but can I leave the bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:11.77,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Miss Reyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:12.81,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:16.18,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm so ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:23.33,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,So we should've waited for \Nhim here to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:25.62,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,Looking all over for him like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.82,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,Who are you calling an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:31.34,main,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.34,0:06:33.15,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,I just pulled an all-nighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.15,0:06:34.83,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Sell me good sleep, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:39.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you for requesting me,\Nmy sleeping beauties and all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:41.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Your Kunon has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:43.15,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Oh, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.11,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,I'm first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:44.84,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,No, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:46.78,main,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Hey, don't cut in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.78,0:06:49.50,main,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,I could collapse from\Nfatigue at any moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:51.22,main,ARIANE/BEATTIE/CICELY,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.17,0:06:58.57,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:06:59.73,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Which course would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.73,0:07:01.56,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,So the thing is, Kunon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.54,0:07:04.10,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.47,0:07:06.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A sinful add-on for princesses \Nwho are in need of cradles,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:10.24,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,to whisk them away to even better sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:13.72,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,That water bed itself \Nprovided a sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.12,0:07:16.99,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,And now magic for even better rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:20.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What would you like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:23.18,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,There are three beds remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.27,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Giant hairless rat...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.61,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.61,0:07:28.38,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,I want to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.39,0:07:44.60,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Ka-shi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.90,main,HANK,0,0,0,,It's easy to produce fire, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:55.41,main - flashback,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think it's possible if you \Ncan maintain a constant heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.78,0:07:57.66,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:02.62,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Keep it low, keep it low.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.35,0:08:10.79,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,Go higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.25,0:08:13.18,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,Higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.19,0:08:17.80,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,A new batch of shi-shilla, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.34,0:08:23.24,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Professor Sureyya was raving about \Nthe quality of your previous report.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:24.96,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:25.80,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:29.01,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm still not convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:34.20,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Why is it necessary for us \Nto make money with magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:39.02,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Ever since you were small,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:42.20,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,you all have only been doing experiments \Nand research on magic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:46.46,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,In society, there are \Npeople who try to deceive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.46,0:08:49.69,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,and take advantage of \Nnaive sorcerers like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:55.22,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Magic is a special power given \Nonly to the chosen people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.48,0:08:59.10,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Our job is to foster sorcerers \Nwho can use that power correctly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:02.29,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,by making them work to \Nlearn about society.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:06.23,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Did that convince you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:07.65,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:12.32,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Now it's Hank and Riyah's \Nturn to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.39,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,I hope it goes well for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.39,0:09:16.43,main,REYES,0,0,0,,They've got Kunon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.24,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:22.24,main,REYES,0,0,0,,He's frivolous, but I'm sure \Nthey'll learn a lot from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.98,0:09:24.31,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Even though he's frivolous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.63,0:09:25.74,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:31.62,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Oh, recruiting for factions \Nhas started today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:33.71,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,Did anyone come to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.71,0:09:34.63,main,REYES,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.63,0:09:37.25,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,No one? What about Kunon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.25,0:09:38.13,main,REYES,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:40.39,main,SAYFIE,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.59,0:09:43.90,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:49.26,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,No word from the students \NI sent out for recruitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.72,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,No need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:53.15,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,It's only the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:54.73,main,GENEVIS,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:03.15,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:16.05,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Factions?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:21.05,main,REYES,0,0,0,,They're the organizations of the \Nstudents in the advanced class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.05,0:10:26.02,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Among them, the three largest factions\Nare Ability, Harmony, and Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:30.91,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Students in the advanced class are \Ntreated as full-fledged sorcerers, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:34.31,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Professors don't intervene \Nmore than necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:37.56,main,HANK,0,0,0,,So these are kind of like mutual \Naid associations of students
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:39.15,main,HANK,0,0,0,,who help each other when in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.15,0:10:40.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You know so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.15,0:10:43.57,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I used to be an assistant \Nto a professor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:46.32,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm not too interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:48.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,since we're in a free environment and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:52.92,main,HANK,0,0,0,,But there are experiments that \Nrequire lots of help, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:56.05,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Belonging to a faction \Ncan be helpful then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:11:01.30,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Doing experiments surrounded \Nby a lot of women, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.57,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Recruitment was forbidden
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.57,0:11:10.63,main,REYES,0,0,0,,for the first month so we \Ncould get used to school life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.13,0:11:14.10,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Apparently yesterday was the opening day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.85,0:11:17.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Can we put in a request?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:21.15,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm thinking about joining Harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.58,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I haven't picked one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.58,0:11:25.91,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I'm still not sure, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.35,0:11:27.56,main - top,SIGN {in order},0,0,0,,ABILITY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:30.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Ability, Harmony, and Rationality, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.68,main - top,SIGN {in order},0,0,0,,ABILITY, HARMONY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:33.42,main - top,SIGN {in order},0,0,0,,ABILITY, HARMONY, RATIONALITY
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.67,0:11:36.67,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Anyways, shall we eat today's bacon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:39.01,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I didn't burn it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:41.05,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I roasted it slowly on a low heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.17,main,KUNON/REYES/HANK/RIYAH,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:46.31,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,It's so salty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.91,0:11:50.05,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Why?! Was it the heat control?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You've gotta try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:02.45,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,What exactly did you do all day yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.81,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.41,0:12:09.20,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Did that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:13.49,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Representative, that tone really suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.49,0:12:14.96,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Like a Demon Lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:18.71,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that this \Nis rather against my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:21.21,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,You couldn't recruit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:23.62,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, representative.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.28,0:12:25.69,main,CICELY,0,0,0,,I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.78,0:12:30.70,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,You fell asleep...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:34.81,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,I just couldn't resist his magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.26,0:12:36.73,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,His giant hairless rat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:38.65,main,BEATTIE,0,0,0,,His giant hairless rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.23,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:46.73,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,As expected of Zeonly's student, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.61,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Hello, Bael and Shilto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.94,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.68,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Stop acting so innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:10.06,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have no intention \Nof letting you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:11.81,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:18.81,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Then shall we decide on the \Norder fair and square?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:23.07,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.98,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Don't you want the incentive fee?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.98,0:13:27.02,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,And the credits?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:29.45,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Way to prey on my vulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.77,0:13:31.38,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,If you ask me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:36.46,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think you're the problematic one here, \Ntrying to get paid for a half-baked job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.49,0:13:40.25,main,HANK,0,0,0,,A critical hit with a fair argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.25,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:44.34,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fu-ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.52,0:13:48.42,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Riyah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:50.57,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hang of floating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.97,0:13:53.69,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then let's try moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.07,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:14:00.73,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Wow! Is this the same as the water bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.73,0:14:03.31,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Yes, because it's dangerous if you fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:10.35,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,There must be no water \NKunon can't produce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:15.10,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,Born to the house of a \Nbaron in countryside,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:18.52,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,I was called the best \Nsorcerer in nation...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:20.00,main - flashback,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Fu-garu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.59,0:14:26.01,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,People thought I was a \Nfuture Royal Sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.34,0:14:28.28,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,but I was a big fish in a small pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.68,0:14:30.51,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Shall we begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:33.14,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you ready, young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:38.94,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,For now, I have to be able to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.40,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,For the sake of my father who \Nscraped together the tuition for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.15,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,and my entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.90,0:14:45.40,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.40,0:14:49.78,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I will record everything, from you \Nflying to falling and tumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.28,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Don't write about me falling and tumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:57.16,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. I'll change that \Nto "he spoke to a girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.42,0:15:00.11,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Oh, then you can say I fell and tumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.09,0:15:06.67,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Is that also a magic \Nexperiment over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.69,0:15:15.79,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,He successfully completed the \Nschool's assignment in a few tries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:19.54,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,His skills are a better fit for \Nour Ability faction, I'd say!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:27.47,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,I hear he has a capacity for teamwork, \Ngiving advice to his classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:29.86,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Harmony is the best fit for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.83,0:15:36.19,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Being a Hero's Scar, and given his \Nexceptional magic that even
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.99,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,made Zeonly acknowledge \Nhim as a student,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:40.46,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,it's only rational that he \Njoins Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:53.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.05,0:15:59.35,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,Is it too weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:02.51,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,But high heat will burn it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:04.48,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,Shall I keep it low?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:09.24,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,So, high heat? High or low...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.62,0:16:11.79,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you going to leave it uncooked now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.79,0:16:13.62,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's a boring failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:14.87,main,HANK,0,0,0,,But this is fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:17.37,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What else can I do other \Nthan low or high heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You were an assistant to a \Nprofessor for a long time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.31,0:16:23.43,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I was diligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.43,0:16:25.63,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I learned the basics and \Ngained lots of knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:28.54,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Then why aren't you \Ntrying anything crafty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:30.82,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,That's what I've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:35.35,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You're not an assistant anymore, \Nso you can let yourself be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:38.72,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Fire can have smell or different colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:43.10,main,HANK,0,0,0,,What? Fire with smell and colors?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.22,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:48.45,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Try every possible means and show \Nme your little magic tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:51.47,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.71,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Hey, Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:56.99,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,Give that rat of yours \Nto this professor, stat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:17:01.56,main,SOFF,0,0,0,,My goodness. Why do you push yourself \N until you get to this state?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.56,0:17:05.00,main,PROFESSOR 1,0,0,0,,But... my research...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:07.58,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Understood! A-ori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:11.83,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Kunon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.89,0:17:16.22,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Is that what Zeonly taught you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:18.90,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,No, my first teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:23.63,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,She taught me that creativity \Nwas a form of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:26.15,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,She yelled at me for calling \Nher magic "little tricks."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:38.10,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Magic is free, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.73,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Fire of a different color...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:51.11,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Fire with smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:53.64,main,HANK,0,0,0,,A smell that fits bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.23,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Wood chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:58.12,main,HANK,0,0,0,,No, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.94,0:18:02.64,main,HANK,0,0,0,,If I can add colors and \Nsmells, why not flavors?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:08.02,main,HANK,0,0,0,,If I add flavor to the aroma of \Nherbs, it should work... Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:13.47,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. This is how one experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.35,0:18:16.57,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,I worked as an assistant \Nfor so long that I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:19.28,main - italics,HANK/I,0,0,0,,Experiments allow you to try many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:23.13,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I've got to surprise him and \Nget the incentive fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.05,0:18:25.19,main,OSDIE,0,0,0,,Hey, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.51,0:18:28.86,main,OSDIE,0,0,0,,Would you like to join Harmony?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:32.26,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Whoa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:38.06,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:46.17,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Oh man, I fell and tumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.79,0:18:50.77,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,You lose balance because you're \Ntrying to forcibly control the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:57.07,main,ARIANE,0,0,0,,Try doing it as if you're going along \Nwith the wind, like you're following it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:01.54,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.96,main,REYES,0,0,0,,It's actually not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:15.09,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Right. I like that it \Nhas aroma and a flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:16.96,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,You did it, Hank!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.10,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:24.47,main,REYES,0,0,0,,It doesn't make me nauseous, and my body \Ndoesn't reject it as a foreign object.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:27.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Let's keep this up and try \Nbacon of different meats.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.87,0:19:30.23,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I knew you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.71,0:19:34.33,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Bacon of fish, chicken, and mutton!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:36.91,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,You made all this, Hank?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.91,0:19:39.06,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Fish is my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.06,0:19:40.43,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:41.64,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,You surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.64,0:19:43.87,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,But I can't eat this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:44.52,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:49.43,main,CHEFF,0,0,0,,At this quality, I'm happy \Nto purchase them from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.25,main,CHEFF,0,0,0,,Looking forward to more tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.56,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Yes! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:59.52,main,REYES,0,0,0,,Did you manage to fly, Riyah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:03.35,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Yes. I got advice from an\Nupperclassman in Rationality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:06.10,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I can't fly too far yet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.41,0:20:08.68,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Once you can successfully \Nfly long distances,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:13.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,I think you can use it to \Nstart a courier service.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:16.89,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I see. That can be a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.65,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kunon! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:23.11,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Of course! And let me \Nwrite a report on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.83,0:20:30.75,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,By the way, I was invited to join \NRationality when I got the advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:34.45,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,And I think I'm going to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.01,0:20:37.96,main - italics,RIYAH/I,0,0,0,,She was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.34,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I was invited to Harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.65,0:20:45.84,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I was invited to Ability, \Nbut I'm not sure about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.84,0:20:50.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,What? Then I'm the only one \Nwho hasn't been invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.33,0:20:51.73,main,HANK,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.73,0:20:54.23,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,With you, Kunon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:56.33,main,RIYAH,0,0,0,,I think they're fighting over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:20:57.73,main,HANK,0,0,0,,I think so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.09,0:20:59.48,main,REYES,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.48,0:21:04.49,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Are you saying girls are fighting over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.77,0:21:19.75,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,The right of the first negotiation with\NKunon Gurion is the Ability faction's!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:23.88,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Harmony will go second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.29,0:21:28.28,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,So Rationality goes third?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.28,0:21:29.76,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:35.64,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,It does give you advantage to negotiate \Nfirst, but he's the one who chooses.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.01,0:21:38.47,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,Lulu was at a disadvantage in \Nterms of his attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.47,0:21:39.77,main,SHILTO,0,0,0,,I feel bad you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:43.82,main,LULOMET,0,0,0,,I agreed to the conditions, \Nso I won't make excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:50.53,main,BAEL,0,0,0,,You're on, the biggest boy \Nmagnet of the faction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.53,0:21:52.53,main,ELIA,0,0,0,,Sure thing, Mr. Bael!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:40.25,main - top,SIGN {top},0,0,0,,NEXT TIME: FAIRIES CHECKING THE ANSWER
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:39.10,main,KUNON,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Fairies \NChecking the Answer."
